  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.6529). This experiment tests whether combining RNA and image data (multimodal) using the same scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (proven effective in image-only models) can further improve accuracy. It isolates the effect of multimodal fusion while leveraging established components, balancing exploration of multimodal benefits with exploitation of prior successes."
}

